        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加图层蒙版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds film grain, strongest in the middle tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加胶片颗粒，中间调处最明显。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds green or magenta to the darkest tones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为最暗的色调添加绿色或洋红色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds or softens contrast along broader shapes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沿较大形状增加或柔化对比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds or softens small detail.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添加或柔化细小细节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjusts the bright parts of the picture. Hold Option to see clipped highlights.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整图像明亮部分。按住 Option 查看高光溢出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjusts the dark parts of the picture. Hold Option to see clipped shadows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整图像暗部。按住 Option 查看阴影溢出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
