    "Chooses how bright an area must be to glow. Has no effect until Glow is raised.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "设定区域发光所需的亮度。提高“辉光”前无效果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chooses how strongly the calibration sliders below are applied. Version 6 is the current default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择下方校准滑块的强度。版本 6 是当前默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
